# The hosts the sign-in proxy forwards to. Exact hosts or *.domain, separated by
# commas or spaces. A wildcard matches one label. IPs, ports and local names are
# refused. See docs/sign-in-proxy.md.

# Empty: Autodesk-hosted Flow PT (*.shotgrid.autodesk.com, *.shotgunstudio.com).
# Set: these hosts only, in place of Autodesk's. If every entry is refused, only
# FPT_EXTRA_HOSTS is allowed. To allow your own site only:
# FPT_HOSTS=yourstudio.shotgrid.autodesk.com
FPT_HOSTS=

# Hosts added to the list above.
FPT_EXTRA_HOSTS=
